Third-party material used by the real-repository benchmark track

Only test files are stored in this repository: for each task, the pull request's test files are copied unchanged into
bench/tasks/hidden/<task>/overlay/, next to the upstream LICENSE and a NOTICE that names the commit. Upstream source trees are
never stored here; the benchmark fetches them into a local cache outside the repository with bench/real/fetch.js and
writes them into each run's working directory.

